WEBVTT

00:01:37.050 --> 00:01:38.920
Brought together with Filia,
who keeps going on about...

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:40.920
...some nonsense about a threat
to the world or something...

00:01:40.990 --> 00:01:43.050
...Lina Inverse travels on
with her squad of lackeys!

00:01:43.130 --> 00:01:44.120
Who are you calling a lackey?!

00:01:44.200 --> 00:01:45.290
Quiet!

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:47.130
Also turning up where
we least expected him...

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.100
...was our old friend Xellos,
the mysterious priest.

00:01:49.170 --> 00:01:51.530
On top of that, I was attacked
by a Monster named Valgaav...

00:01:51.600 --> 00:01:53.760
...who's out to avenge Gaav,
the Demon Dragon King!

00:01:53.840 --> 00:01:56.100
And then a powerful and mysterious
enemy entered the scene as well.

00:01:56.170 --> 00:01:58.540
Looks like your prophecy
may have something to it...

00:01:58.610 --> 00:02:01.100
Uh, Filia, are you even
listening to me?

00:02:01.180 --> 00:02:03.610
Oh, I was just
having a cup of tea.

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:14.350
No! We simply must
take the path to the right!

00:02:14.430 --> 00:02:19.020
Oh, really? I think we should
take the one to the left.

00:02:19.330 --> 00:02:20.700
Oh, no!

00:02:21.470 --> 00:02:23.460
"Oh, no"?

00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:27.400
No Monster is going
to trick me THAT easily!

00:02:27.470 --> 00:02:30.270
Oh?! You're just going to
dismiss me out of hand?

00:02:30.340 --> 00:02:32.280
Why do those two act like that?

00:02:32.440 --> 00:02:37.780
I doubted they'd stay civil to each
other for long on this trip, but still...

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:39.980
Yeah. The Dragon race and...

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:41.880
...the Monster race have
been enemies for so long.

00:02:41.950 --> 00:02:43.890
It's like mixing oil and water.

00:02:43.950 --> 00:02:45.720
Look, I couldn't
care less about this.

00:02:46.120 --> 00:02:48.060
So, your way is
the shortest way to...

00:02:48.130 --> 00:02:51.090
...the temple of the Fire Dragon
King you told us about, right?

00:02:51.160 --> 00:02:51.890
I don't know!

00:02:53.460 --> 00:02:56.370
Don't you understand? I'm a
priestess of the Fire Dragon King!

00:02:56.430 --> 00:02:59.630
As such, I simply can't lower
myself to agreeing with...

00:02:59.700 --> 00:03:03.140
...some Monster who serves
some decrepit old dark lord...

00:03:03.210 --> 00:03:06.110
...who's covered in ice in
the mountains of the North!

00:03:08.110 --> 00:03:12.340
Oh, my. You're such
a selfish person, eh, Filia?

00:03:13.120 --> 00:03:15.980
Oh, I meant DRAGON, not person.

00:03:16.350 --> 00:03:18.820
Guess you can't
help being what you are.

00:03:20.720 --> 00:03:23.450
Who are you calling SELFISH?!

00:03:25.060 --> 00:03:28.460
No, stop that!
Making us waste time here...

00:03:28.530 --> 00:03:31.160
...is just what this evil
Monster wants us to do!

00:03:31.240 --> 00:03:33.900
I have an important
duty to perform!

00:03:34.740 --> 00:03:36.600
There's the approaching
threat, after all...

00:03:39.610 --> 00:03:42.080
A duty to save the world!

00:03:45.250 --> 00:03:47.380
Come, let us be off, Miss Lina!

00:03:47.750 --> 00:03:50.380
The world is waiting for you!

00:03:50.450 --> 00:03:51.790
Bravo!

00:03:51.860 --> 00:03:54.050
Oh, enough already!

00:04:00.700 --> 00:04:03.290
All right!
The wait is finally over!

00:04:03.730 --> 00:04:10.040
You've been waiting for me!
You delicious-looking food, you!

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:12.770
Really! Oh, it's wonderful!

00:04:14.010 --> 00:04:17.500
Your path really turned out
to be the right one, Filia!

00:04:17.820 --> 00:04:20.080
This isn't the reason I chose it...

00:04:20.480 --> 00:04:24.050
Hey! Hey! What sort of
food is Dradora Surprise?

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:26.580
Y- You want to order more?

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:28.520
You certainly set
your sights high.

00:04:28.590 --> 00:04:31.580
If you don't try Dradora
Surprise in this town...

00:04:32.230 --> 00:04:34.490
...you'll regret it for
the rest of your life.

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:36.060
It's that good?

00:04:36.400 --> 00:04:38.390
We take a fresh, whole dradora...

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:41.400
...and then cook it up in
a sumptuous soup stock.

00:04:41.870 --> 00:04:44.200
The mixture of flavors
are perfectly matched...

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:46.140
...with the essence
of the dradora.

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:47.680
The taste is simply stupendous!

00:04:47.750 --> 00:04:50.240
I dunno what any of that means,
but it sounds good!

00:04:50.310 --> 00:04:52.250
All right! Add that
to our order, please!

00:04:53.380 --> 00:04:54.580
Happy to oblige.

00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:56.910
And hurry up with that!

00:04:57.860 --> 00:05:01.260
Miss Lina! Don't you
understand that time is passing?!

00:05:02.030 --> 00:05:07.190
While we do this, what are Valgaav
and those other Monsters up to?

00:05:07.730 --> 00:05:12.130
Which is more important? A dinner
surprise or a threat to the world?!

00:05:13.140 --> 00:05:14.830
Right now, the dinner surprise!

00:05:15.170 --> 00:05:18.610
Look, if they need the Sword of
Light for whatever they're doing...

00:05:18.680 --> 00:05:22.110
...then they'll come to us
no matter where we go.

00:05:22.180 --> 00:05:26.480
However, you can only get
Dradora Surprise in this town.

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:27.480
Yeah! Yeah!

00:05:28.950 --> 00:05:30.010
Oh, my!

00:05:30.320 --> 00:05:33.410
Her logic is impeccable!
Well argued, Lina!

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:37.260
This is your fault.

00:05:38.930 --> 00:05:41.990
Because of her association
with a filthy Monster like you...

00:05:42.070 --> 00:05:44.660
...Miss Lina's personality
has become twisted!

00:05:44.740 --> 00:05:46.130
Hey! What's that
supposed to mean?!

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:48.870
I can't put up
with this any longer!

00:05:53.440 --> 00:05:55.210
Hold it! Hold it!

00:05:55.280 --> 00:05:56.710
You're going to
transform in HERE?!

00:05:56.780 --> 00:05:58.300
Think about where you are!

00:06:00.620 --> 00:06:03.850
Oh, my, so you transform
when you get a little irritated?

00:06:03.920 --> 00:06:05.720
You're not very well trained...

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:08.420
...for a priestess of the
Fire Dragon King, are you?

00:06:13.130 --> 00:06:15.830
Using brute force when they can't
get something by arguing for it.

00:06:15.900 --> 00:06:21.340
The Dragon race loves to
resort to violence, doesn't it?

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:27.270
You've been saving that one
since she made that crack...

00:06:27.340 --> 00:06:29.940
...about serving a decrepit
old dark lord, haven't you?

00:06:32.920 --> 00:06:34.350
- Filia!
- Filia!

00:06:35.520 --> 00:06:36.610
Please leave me alone!

00:06:37.920 --> 00:06:38.790
Oh, brother...

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:42.720
It looks like Miss Filia took
that last comment really hard.

00:06:42.790 --> 00:06:43.560
Yeah...

00:06:44.390 --> 00:06:47.120
Well, she'll come back
when she gets hungry.

00:06:47.200 --> 00:06:50.000
Until then, we can enjoy
the Dradora Surprise!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.600
And who'll pay for it?

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:56.570
The only one of us with
local currency is Filia.

00:06:57.010 --> 00:07:00.700
So, you mean... We don't have
a coin to our name right now?

00:07:00.780 --> 00:07:02.510
What are we going to
do about the bill here?

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:05.080
I can't believe this!

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:08.020
How could we let Filia wander alone
and heart-broken in a strange town?!

00:07:08.450 --> 00:07:10.480
Is that how you
people treat friends?!

00:07:10.820 --> 00:07:12.220
Well, that's not my style!

00:07:12.290 --> 00:07:14.620
I won't abandon Filia
when she's feeling down!

00:07:14.690 --> 00:07:17.160
Come on, everyone!
Let's go to her right now!

00:07:17.730 --> 00:07:19.460
Um, Miss Lina?

00:07:19.530 --> 00:07:21.520
This is our only choice.
Let's go, Amelia!

00:07:21.600 --> 00:07:22.260
Right...

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:33.240
My dear customers... The Dradora
Surprise will be ready soon.

00:07:34.910 --> 00:07:35.810
Gone...

00:07:37.110 --> 00:07:40.050
TH-TH-TH-THI EVES!!!

00:07:40.120 --> 00:07:41.350
Oh, I knew it!

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:43.440
THI EVES!!!

00:07:44.590 --> 00:07:46.180
Oh, dear...

00:07:51.860 --> 00:07:53.020
Whoa! It's raining!

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:04.740
Why must I keep
enduring these hardships?

00:08:04.810 --> 00:08:08.610
Is Miss Lina really
going to save the world?

00:08:09.310 --> 00:08:12.210
Someone who traffics Monsters?!

00:08:12.780 --> 00:08:18.380
With that Xellos...
Xellos! Xellos!!

00:08:24.330 --> 00:08:26.630
Oh, dear!
Did I just reveal myself?!

00:08:26.700 --> 00:08:28.600
All this human
contact is getting to me.

00:08:28.670 --> 00:08:31.130
Are you the dragon priestess?

00:08:31.570 --> 00:08:34.200
Uh, yes. I am.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.670
Just like the report said.

00:08:37.910 --> 00:08:40.780
You have a lot of nerve, coming
to this town after all this time!

00:08:40.840 --> 00:08:43.180
Wh- What do you mean?
I was just...

00:08:43.350 --> 00:08:48.750
Don't play dumb! We know
you're here to destroy this town!

00:08:49.450 --> 00:08:50.550
Destroy?

00:08:53.720 --> 00:08:54.880
Exactly!

00:08:54.960 --> 00:08:58.890
Your appearing in a town forbidden
to dragons is proof enough!

00:08:59.060 --> 00:09:01.960
F- Forbidden to dragons?!

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:05.030
Wh- What's?

00:09:07.770 --> 00:09:15.200
Long ago, this town was
destroyed by an evil dragon!

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:20.180
According to the legend,
a lone hero killed the beast.

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:23.910
Peace returned to
this land once again...

00:09:24.760 --> 00:09:27.990
...but if you, a dragon priestess
who serves those things, is here...

00:09:28.060 --> 00:09:30.750
...then some calamity
must be upon us!

00:09:31.160 --> 00:09:33.100
I can't believe such a legend!

00:09:33.160 --> 00:09:34.820
It must have been
a misunderstanding!

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.900
You think that
will work, you fool?!

00:09:36.970 --> 00:09:39.700
Yeah, yeah! Let's grab her!

00:09:41.200 --> 00:09:45.330
Stop this at once! I said it
was a misunderstanding!

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:50.500
The Dragon race loves to
resort to violence, doesn't it?

00:09:59.390 --> 00:10:03.520
Very well, then.
I will neither run nor hide.

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:08.660
I am not like a Monster! I'm sure
we can reach an understanding.

00:10:08.730 --> 00:10:10.830
Well, ain't she an easy one?

00:10:14.140 --> 00:10:15.730
You people?!

00:10:17.340 --> 00:10:21.640
I was the helpful guy who told them
a dragon priestess was in town.

00:10:21.710 --> 00:10:25.880
We did it, Boss!
I say we off her, right here!

00:10:25.950 --> 00:10:30.850
You idiot! Lord Valgaav ordered
us to use our heads, remember?

00:10:31.920 --> 00:10:36.050
We'll use her as a hostage
to get the Sword of Light.

00:10:36.130 --> 00:10:39.820
So we have to take good care
of our hostage. Got that?!

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:42.230
Gotcha! Take good
care of the hostage!

00:10:44.600 --> 00:10:47.630
Oh, no, you don't!
Get her, guys!

00:11:05.880 --> 00:11:07.350
Go on! Get inside!

00:11:23.640 --> 00:11:24.930
Um... Excuse me?

00:11:25.340 --> 00:11:26.670
Yeah? What?

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:31.870
I was thinking I'd just transform
into a dragon and escape, but...

00:11:31.940 --> 00:11:35.040
Well... It involves me...
getting naked.

00:11:35.110 --> 00:11:38.170
And with you standing guard there,
I'd be terribly embarrassed.

00:11:38.250 --> 00:11:40.740
So, could you please turn
around for a moment?

00:11:40.820 --> 00:11:44.050
Are you an idiot?!
Like anyone'd do that for you?!

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:46.490
Like I'd miss seeing you naked?!

00:11:46.560 --> 00:11:49.390
I'll be keeping my eyes on
you every step of the way!

00:11:50.230 --> 00:11:52.030
Oh! How can this be?

00:11:52.770 --> 00:11:56.220
I'm supposed to save the world,
and this happens?

00:11:58.040 --> 00:11:59.200
Wh- Who's there?!

00:12:06.550 --> 00:12:08.980
I refuse to get naked for you!

00:12:11.020 --> 00:12:13.250
Huh? You mean...
You brought this for me?

00:12:13.950 --> 00:12:18.290
Y- Yeah. Boss said we gotta
take good care of the hostage.

00:12:19.190 --> 00:12:21.060
H- Here, have some.

00:12:25.300 --> 00:12:28.390
I see Monsters traffic with
all sorts of people, don't they?

00:12:28.470 --> 00:12:31.900
The Monster I know is
a treacherous egomaniac...

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:33.630
...who's a complete smart-aleck!

00:12:33.710 --> 00:12:36.570
He seems like the type who
just likes to tease other people!

00:12:39.210 --> 00:12:42.510
I get furious just
thinking about him!

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:46.750
You get picked on by your
own gang? You poor thing.

00:12:47.250 --> 00:12:50.620
Well, don't you worry. I'm gonna
do what the boss ordered...

00:12:50.690 --> 00:12:53.420
...and take good care of
the hostage, so cheer up!

00:12:54.890 --> 00:12:56.990
Don't touch me, you animal!

00:12:57.830 --> 00:13:01.130
It's almost time for your trial,
little Miss Priestess!

00:13:03.870 --> 00:13:06.030
Wh- What are you two doing?!

00:13:06.670 --> 00:13:10.010
Where could Filia have run off to?

00:13:10.710 --> 00:13:14.840
Man, that girl's a pain and a half!
And Xellos has disappeared, too.

00:13:15.180 --> 00:13:17.940
Anyway, we have to
get Filia back, and fast!

00:13:18.020 --> 00:13:19.570
You seem awfully motivated.

00:13:19.650 --> 00:13:22.780
Because we still haven't
tried that Dradora Surprise!

00:13:22.860 --> 00:13:24.350
That's what I figured.

00:13:24.520 --> 00:13:28.650
We've got trouble!
Miss Filia's been!

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:33.090
This trial of public justice
is now in session!

00:13:33.170 --> 00:13:36.760
We shall determine whether or
not this girl is actually a dragon!

00:13:40.670 --> 00:13:42.540
Your Honor, I object!

00:13:42.610 --> 00:13:45.670
It's true I'm a priestess of the
Fire Dragon King, but I'm not...

00:13:46.010 --> 00:13:49.000
Silence!
Your defense will be allowed...

00:13:49.080 --> 00:13:51.280
...only after the Dragon
Judgement is conducted!

00:13:52.020 --> 00:13:54.420
"Dragon Judgement"?

00:13:58.220 --> 00:14:01.090
Oh! The legendary
Dragon Judgement!

00:14:01.160 --> 00:14:04.460
The legendary hero also used it
to reveal the dragon's true form!

00:14:05.560 --> 00:14:08.360
Now! We shall commence
the Dragon Judgement!

00:14:08.430 --> 00:14:10.700
Commence the Dragon Judgement!

00:14:16.340 --> 00:14:18.830
Wh- What?! That's!

00:14:21.850 --> 00:14:25.780
Now, Dragon, we'll reveal your
true form with this tickler!

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:30.080
Here... we... GO!!!

00:14:32.660 --> 00:14:37.560
Take that! And that!
Show your true form! Come on!

00:14:38.460 --> 00:14:42.090
What? Are they just
making fun of me?

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:50.970
You saw her sneeze?!
Definite proof of dragonhood!

00:14:54.380 --> 00:14:57.610
A dragon! She's a dragon!

00:14:57.680 --> 00:14:58.910
This is a joke, right?

00:14:59.720 --> 00:15:02.980
This girl is hereby judged
to be a dragon!

00:15:03.190 --> 00:15:04.620
Fire... BALL!

00:15:06.220 --> 00:15:07.560
What's going on?!

00:15:11.230 --> 00:15:12.820
M- Miss Lina!

00:15:12.900 --> 00:15:14.990
Why are you goofing
around here, Filia?

00:15:15.070 --> 00:15:17.930
We still haven't gotten to
eat the Dradora Surprise.

00:15:18.670 --> 00:15:20.730
C'mon! Time to
get to the next town!

00:15:20.810 --> 00:15:21.770
Miss Lina...

00:15:21.840 --> 00:15:24.270
Hey! You pulled a
dine and dash on me!

00:15:24.380 --> 00:15:25.840
Yikes! Uh-oh...

00:15:26.040 --> 00:15:27.940
I've found you, you thieves!

00:15:28.010 --> 00:15:29.310
You ran off
without paying him?!

00:15:29.550 --> 00:15:32.950
That is so pathetic!
Shame on you, Miss Lina!

00:15:33.750 --> 00:15:37.210
Hey! Whose fault was it
we couldn't pay?! Whose?!

00:15:38.860 --> 00:15:40.850
Wha! You guys!

00:15:41.830 --> 00:15:44.190
It's clear who the
heroes are here, folks!

00:15:44.830 --> 00:15:46.420
Those people are
friends of the dragon!

00:15:47.070 --> 00:15:49.430
What makes you the heroes?!

00:15:49.770 --> 00:15:51.930
Dragons and lizards are
both reptiles!

00:15:52.640 --> 00:15:54.270
They're the SAME,
aren't they?!

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:59.000
Miss Amelia...
Please don't call me a "reptile."

00:15:59.310 --> 00:16:03.250
Oh, forget this!
I'm using all my powers!

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:04.910
LEVITATION!

00:16:04.980 --> 00:16:06.380
Hey! Wait for me!

00:16:08.750 --> 00:16:10.620
I won't let you take her!

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:19.260
Gotta take care of the hostage!

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:21.960
How DARE you do that!

00:16:22.830 --> 00:16:23.820
Lina!

00:16:26.540 --> 00:16:28.130
Wh- What are you guys doing?!

00:16:28.370 --> 00:16:32.040
S- Sorcery!
You people aren't human!

00:16:32.110 --> 00:16:33.440
You're that dragon's lackeys!

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:36.210
Yeah! Let's get 'em!

00:16:36.780 --> 00:16:39.220
Hey! What's the big idea?!

00:16:39.280 --> 00:16:43.450
Forget it! These guys aren't going
to listen to anything we say!

00:16:43.520 --> 00:16:45.290
HUH? You mean?

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:48.550
I'll let them finish you off!

00:16:48.630 --> 00:16:52.030
Then I can take the Sword of
Light when it's all over!

00:16:52.260 --> 00:16:53.820
M- Miss Lina!

00:16:54.970 --> 00:16:58.770
Oh, dear.
I suppose I have no choice.

00:17:00.010 --> 00:17:01.630
It's all my fault...

00:17:01.710 --> 00:17:04.570
It's my fault Miss Lina
and the others are in danger.

00:17:05.740 --> 00:17:07.110
Yes, exactly!

00:17:08.650 --> 00:17:09.810
Xellos!

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:12.510
I really have to laugh at this.

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:14.880
Things are this desperate and
you're completely useless.

00:17:15.990 --> 00:17:18.220
So, this is the best you can do?

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:21.190
Guess the Dragon race really
isn't so tough after all!

00:17:22.130 --> 00:17:24.490
What did you say?!

00:17:30.300 --> 00:17:34.670
Oh, my, so that's all a golden
dragon is really capable of?

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:37.230
They're nowhere near a
match for the Monster race.

00:17:37.340 --> 00:17:38.830
Oh, how dull.

00:17:40.050 --> 00:17:44.310
What... What...
WHAT DI D YOU SAY?!!

00:17:56.700 --> 00:17:58.690
She really is a dragon!

00:18:00.200 --> 00:18:04.640
Xellos! Come back here!

00:18:10.480 --> 00:18:14.310
Make a fool of me, will you?!
You're gonna be sorry!

00:18:16.520 --> 00:18:19.350
Th-Th-That girl really is...

00:18:19.420 --> 00:18:21.080
...a dragon?!

00:18:22.090 --> 00:18:24.020
Oh, didn't you know?

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:34.260
Xellos!

00:18:34.970 --> 00:18:37.430
Xellos! Xellos! Xellos!

00:18:37.500 --> 00:18:41.060
Where are you?!
Come out and face me!

00:18:42.710 --> 00:18:47.840
I knew it... The dragon's
here to destroy the town.

00:18:51.020 --> 00:18:52.880
Forget it. Not my problem.

00:18:53.320 --> 00:18:56.480
Wow, she'd be a good match
for when Lina gets mad!

00:18:56.560 --> 00:18:58.850
Between Sylphiel and Amelia...

00:18:58.920 --> 00:19:00.860
...we have enough
clerics to worry about.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:02.290
And what's that
supposed to mean?

00:19:03.090 --> 00:19:05.220
XELLOS!

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:08.770
Oh, dear.

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:15.400
Cheer up, Filia. At least we
all got away in one piece.

00:19:15.470 --> 00:19:17.270
I was a disgrace!

00:19:18.080 --> 00:19:21.710
Becoming naked in front
of that many people!

00:19:21.780 --> 00:19:24.410
I have a long way to go as a
priestess of the Fire Dragon King!

00:19:24.480 --> 00:19:26.540
C'mon, it wasn't
that big a disgrace.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:29.810
But if that piece
of garbage Monster...

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:32.520
...hadn't started teasing me
when you were all in trouble!

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:34.950
Heh... C'mon, he probably
was doing it on purpose.

00:19:35.730 --> 00:19:37.720
To draw out your full power.

00:19:38.000 --> 00:19:40.900
Huh? My full?

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:45.700
Well, I wish I'd gotten just a
taste of that Dradora Surprise.

00:19:45.770 --> 00:19:47.470
I wonder what goes into it?

00:19:47.870 --> 00:19:50.540
Something called a surprise
has got to be pretty weird.

00:19:50.610 --> 00:19:52.340
Oh, if you want to know...

00:19:52.580 --> 00:19:53.440
...I have it in here.

00:19:53.710 --> 00:19:55.540
Huh?! What's it say?!

00:19:55.610 --> 00:19:56.880
According to this guidebook...

00:19:57.450 --> 00:20:00.440
...it's considered a
fairly low-quality dish.

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:06.090
You're probably
lucky you didn't eat it.

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:12.590
If you had a guidebook...

00:20:13.630 --> 00:20:17.000
...you must have known dragons
were taboo in that town.

00:20:17.700 --> 00:20:21.500
Then why didn't you say
so in the first place?

00:20:21.970 --> 00:20:27.100
Why do you think? It was
much more amusing this way.

00:20:27.180 --> 00:20:31.580
And didn't she cause a mess there?
I have new respect for her!

00:20:31.650 --> 00:20:35.640
Oh, really... That's the reason.
I understand perfectly!

00:20:39.930 --> 00:20:42.290
Oh, dear!
I was complimenting you!

00:20:42.360 --> 00:20:44.350
Did I say something wrong?

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:52.660
I get the feeling their
relationship is more dangerous...

00:20:52.740 --> 00:20:55.730
...than whatever's
threatening the world.

00:20:55.910 --> 00:20:57.530
Well, they're only human.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:59.340
No, they aren't!

00:21:00.280 --> 00:21:02.080
I hate this!

00:22:23.030 --> 00:22:26.360
Just a quick side trip,
where treasure awaits me!

00:22:26.430 --> 00:22:28.700
Huh? Something's
definitely strange here.

00:22:29.100 --> 00:22:31.760
Next time: " Wandering Around?
The Runaway Shrine Takes a Trip!"

00:22:32.300 --> 00:22:35.140
You'd better watch, or I'll
REALLY cause some trouble!
